From: VipinVIP <VipinVIP@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] interconnect: qcom: qcs615: add the missing ACV enable_mask

The ACV BCM needs enable_mask = 0x8 (the vote downstream sends is 0x60000008); without it
mainline sends the ACV vote as invalid.
---
--- a/drivers/interconnect/qcom/qcs615.c
+++ b/drivers/interconnect/qcom/qcs615.c
@@ -1195,6 +1195,7 @@
 
 static struct qcom_icc_bcm bcm_acv = {
 	.name = "ACV",
+	.enable_mask = 0x8,
 	.num_nodes = 1,
 	.nodes = { &ebi },
 };
